MODULE: AbandonedRecoveryRequiresHistory
TARGET: Converges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: an abandoned commit-triggered rebuild is incorrectly gated on retained history
PERTURBS: RecoverAbandoned

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "idle" /\ ~requested /\ abandoned /\ KnownTerminals # {}
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase = "idle" /\ ~requested /\ abandoned /\ KnownTerminals # {}
    /\ HistoryEntitled
--- END
